			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Nimrod"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 400040301,
					"content": "Huh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040302,
					"content": "Hey! You're the guy, right? Kaeya's informant?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040303,
					"content": "Informant? Not me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040304,
					"content": "But... This is the place we agreed upon... and you're the only other one here, so...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040305,
					"content": "\"Place we agreed upon\"? Heh, I know nothing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040307,
					"content": "Wine begets wisdom.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400040310,
					"content": "Something about... wine?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400040306,
					"content": "Ugh, stop being so annoying!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040307,
						400040310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040308,
					"content": "Okay. Yeah, it's me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040309,
					"content": "How was any of that even slightly necessary!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040311,
					"content": "Uh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040312,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040313,
					"content": "Okay... technically the wrong password, but... yes, it's something about wine, and assuming that something is the thing about it begetting wisdom, then...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040314,
					"content": "Yeah, close enough. It's me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040315,
					"content": "How was any of that even slightly necessary!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040316,
					"content": "What do you want to know about?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040317,
					"content": "*sigh* Here's the situation...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040318,
					"content": "Okay. I see.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040319,
					"content": "So? What can you tell us as an insider?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040320,
					"content": "I do not think this is the work of the Treasure Hoarders.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040321,
					"content": "The reason the Treasure Hoarders are able to sustain a giant cross-border operation is because they abide by one fundamental principle:",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040322,
					"content": "Caution. Softly softly catchee monkey is the name of the game for them. By contrast, the idea of taking huge risks to try and make a fortune is utter folly in their eyes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040323,
					"content": "Liyue has the adepti looking after it, doesn't it? And they're especially active during the Lantern Rite...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040324,
					"content": "",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040325,
					"content": "There's just no way that we... sorry, \"they\"! Slip of the tongue — when you've been undercover as long as I have, heh, where was I... Oh, yes — There's just no way that they — the Treasure Hoarders — would dare make a move during the Lantern Rite.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040326,
					"content": "Also... the Treasure Hoarders' organization in Liyue recently received an anonymous letter.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040327,
					"content": "Why would someone send them an anonymous letter? Trying to frame them, perhaps?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040328,
					"content": "Nobody knows. But what I can tell you is which branch of the Treasure Hoarders has the letter in their possession.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040329,
					"content": "...There. I've marked their location on the map for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040330,
					"content": "#Great. Well, Paimon thinks this was productive! {NICKNAME}, this is our only solid lead. Let's not waste it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040331,
					"content": "If there's nothing more, I should get back to treasure hoarding. ...I mean, get back to those treasure-hoarding lowlifes. To spy on them. Heh.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Nimrod"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4000408,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4000408
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4000408",
